! pins ~ the house's pinned calls

The bare `lares` (lar:///lares.lararium.status) shows these calls beneath its status line, the first rung of the memetic gradient: each a runnable call sigil, one per line, unfolding by its own range. The house list stands here in canon; the worn face's own list layers above it (its daemon wiki, lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/lararium/pins), and a mandate's `pins` field above that. Re-pin by writing this record's `#/pins` slot in your own layer: mutability at the root.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/pins`>>

